{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Daily Quiz": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) 5<sup>z</sup> + 5<sup>1 - z</sup> = 6 হলে, z = কত?", "option1": "ক) 1, 2", "option2": "খ) 1, 0", "option3": "গ) 2, 3", "option4": "ঘ) -1, 2", "answer": "2", "exp": "5<sup>z</sup> + 5<sup>1 - z</sup> = 6<br />&rArr; 5<sup>z</sup> + 5<sup>1</sup>/5<sup>z</sup> = 6<br />&rArr; 5<sup>z</sup> + 5/5<sup>z</sup> = 6<br />&rArr;&nbsp;a + 5/a = 6 [ 5<sup>z</sup> = a ]<br />&rArr;&nbsp;a<sup>2</sup> + 5 = 6a<br />&rArr;&nbsp;a<sup>2</sup> - 6a + 5 = 0<br />&rArr;&nbsp;a<sup>2</sup> -5a - a + 5 = 0<br />&rArr;&nbsp;a(a - 5) - 1(a - 5) = 0<br />&rArr;&nbsp;(a - 5)(a - 1) = 0<br />&there4; a - 5 = 0<br />&rArr;&nbsp;a = 5<br />&rArr;&nbsp;5<sup>z</sup> = 5<sup>1</sup><br />&rArr;&nbsp;z = 1<br />অথবা,<br />a - 1 = 0<br />&rArr;&nbsp;a = 1<br />&rArr;&nbsp;5<sup>z</sup> = 5<sup>0</sup><br />&rArr;&nbsp;z = 0"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) 5<sup>4y + 6</sup> = 125<sup>y + 2</sup> হলে, y = ?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) 3", "answer": "1", "exp": "5<sup>4y + 6</sup> = 125<sup>y + 2</sup>&nbsp;<br />&rArr; 5<sup>4y + 6</sup> = 5<sup>3(y + 2)</sup><br />&rArr;&nbsp;5<sup>4y + 6</sup> = 5<sup>3y + 6</sup><br />&rArr;&nbsp;4y + 6 = 3y + 6<br />&rArr;&nbsp;y = 0"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) 9<sup>q</sup> + 9<sup>q</sup> + 9<sup>q</sup> = ?", "option1": "ক) 3<sup>1 + 2q</sup>", "option2": "খ) 3<sup>1 - 2q</sup>", "option3": "গ) 3<sup>2q - 1</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) 9<sup>1 + q</sup>", "answer": "1", "exp": "9<sup>q</sup> + 9<sup>q</sup> + 9<sup>q</sup> <br />= 3 &times; 9<sup>q</sup> <br />= 3 &times; (3<sup>2</sup>)<sup>q</sup> <br />= 3<sup>1</sup> &times; 3<sup>2q</sup> <br />= 3<sup>1 + 2q</sup>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) (m/n)<sup>p - 7</sup>&nbsp;= (n/m)<sup>p - 9</sup> হলে, p এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 2", "option2": "খ) 4", "option3": "গ) 6", "option4": "ঘ) 8", "answer": "4", "exp": "(m/n)<sup>p - 7</sup>&nbsp;= (n/m)<sup>p - 9</sup>&nbsp;<br />&rArr;